        "locator": "code://1e28b4203b/src/sysdolphin/baselib/texpdag.c#L300-L328",
        "digest": "sha256:1f7eed8ae9854874"
      },
      "disposition": "retain",
      "reason": "Copies num direct u32 rows to full, repeatedly unions full[j] into every row containing bit j, and stops after a pass adds no bits. Monotonic finite bit growth computes transitive closure for valid row storage and bit indices. Does not validate acyclicity.",
