        "to_target_id": null,
        "to_entity_id": "game_concept:game_concept:gamecube-tev-color-combiner",
        "role": "implements",
        "why": "CalcDistance follows TEV color and alpha expression dependencies to calculate the node depths that HSD_TExpMakeDag uses when constructing the graph for subsequent TEV-expression scheduling.",
        "kind": "code",
        "locator": "code://1e28b4203b/src/sysdolphin/baselib/texpdag.c#L205-L240",
        "digest": "sha256:cda5125b71400ffc"
      },
      "disposition": "retain",
      "reason": "Looks up the expression pointer in tevs, returns if absent or candidate depth is not greater than stored depth, otherwise updates the parallel distance and recursively traverses type1 color and alpha inputs with depth+1. On an acyclic graph with all nodes collected this computes maximum root-to-node depth. Cycles are not guarded. MakeDag subsequently performs adjacent swaps using these distances; a complete sorted order is not established by those loops.",
      "canonical_evidence": [
